woche
kw
kalenderwoche
# The plural is NOT a week-number surface: a German week number is always
# singular ("die 2. Woche", "KW 2", "Kalenderwoche 2"), and the plural names
# a COUNT of weeks. Listing it let the ordinal order read the bare counted
# length "2 wochen" as calendar week 2, answering a date six months before
# the anchor.
